# That is what makes them worth retrying: the likely reason was "no D11 release yet", and the
# ecosystem has moved since.
#
# These are NOT automatically re-served — .campaign-skip still excludes them. To retry a batch:
#
#   head -40 scripts/.campaign-recheck | grep -v '^#' > wave.txt
#   # then the normal safe-install / wave-prepare cycle
#
# Anything that fails again should be moved back into .campaign-skip WITH a reason this time,
# and removed from this file.

